        "description": "Deployed preview. What is this fund and how is it doing? Profile, NAV, holdings, debentures, FII properties.\n\none row per family the CNPJ files under. With no id: the  registry view, ordered by cnpj, paged with order + limit + offset.\n\nThis playground selects `profile` on `GET /funds`. See the [full resource reference](/api-docs/v2/reference/funds) for all variants.",
